// What the model gives, written by `BLESS=1`.
run: every order
outcome 1
  refused
  value ?a: i32
  value X: i32
  value `m(x)`: ()
  value `n(x)`: ()
  decision m: m#0
  decision n: n#1
  check `?a <= X`: Ok(Identity)
  check `X ~> m.Param(0)`: Err(None)
  check `X ~> n.Param(0)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `m.CommonResult <= m(x)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `n.CommonResult <= n(x)`: Ok(Identity)
  I* of a final state: [completeness m]
